{"id":"eingefallen","lemma":"eingefallen","pos":"adj","rank":3273,"glosses":["hollow, sunken (e.g. of cheeks)"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯nɡəˌfalən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/De-eingefallen.ogg/De-eingefallen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Eine gute Idee ist ihm eingefallen.","en":"A good idea came to him.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"idea"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},null]},{"text":"Mir ist etwas Gutes eingefallen.","en":"I had a good idea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394841","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"something"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Ich glaube, mir ist was eingefallen.","en":"I think I have an idea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756471","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Warum ist mir das nicht eingefallen?","en":"Why didn't I think of this?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Das ist mir nicht eingefallen.","en":"That hadn't occurred to me.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}